+    // animation frame), the expensive per-effect results (feTurbulence noise,
+    // lighting, blurs) are still valid — effect instances are cached on the SVG
+    // primitive elements, so FilterResults keys stay stable across rebuilds.
+    // Retire the results on removal and re-seed the rebuilt filter with them
+    // when the geometry matches; source-dependent results are always cleared.
